@lang en
IMPORT `vn14-ch5-claims-and-termination`

-- Tests for Chapter 1 (Articles 1 to 11). Every expected value was worked by hand from the
-- figures, dates and conditions the SOURCE states, before the assertion was run; the working is
-- in the comment beside each group. A failing assertion here is a finding, never a value to
-- edit. Amounts are VND. The dates, ages and account values are hypothetical scenarios.

§ `Tests — Chapter 1`

§§ `Fixtures`

GIVEN `as at` IS A DATE
      `date of birth` IS A DATE
GIVETH A `The person's particulars`
`a person who meets every other condition of 1.4, as at` `as at` `, born on` `date of birth` MEANS
    `The person's particulars` WITH
        `as at`                                          IS `as at`
        `date of birth`                                  IS `date of birth`
        `recorded in the List of Insured Members`        IS TRUE
        `present in Vietnam`                             IS TRUE
        `holds a valid Enrolment Form`                   IS TRUE
        `premium for this person paid to the Company`    IS TRUE
        `resident in Vietnam`                            IS TRUE
        `of full civil capacity under the Civil Code`    IS TRUE
        `full years of employment with the Policyholder` IS JUST 5

`a person abroad on the request date` MEANS
    `The person's particulars` WITH
        `as at`                                          IS YMD 2026 3 1
        `date of birth`                                  IS YMD 1990 5 5
        `recorded in the List of Insured Members`        IS TRUE
        `present in Vietnam`                             IS FALSE
        `holds a valid Enrolment Form`                   IS TRUE
        `premium for this person paid to the Company`    IS TRUE
        `resident in Vietnam`                            IS TRUE
        `of full civil capacity under the Civil Code`    IS TRUE
        `full years of employment with the Policyholder` IS JUST 5

`a person without a valid Enrolment Form` MEANS
    `The person's particulars` WITH
        `as at`                                          IS YMD 2026 3 1
        `date of birth`                                  IS YMD 1990 5 5
        `recorded in the List of Insured Members`        IS TRUE
        `present in Vietnam`                             IS TRUE
        `holds a valid Enrolment Form`                   IS FALSE
        `premium for this person paid to the Company`    IS TRUE
        `resident in Vietnam`                            IS TRUE
        `of full civil capacity under the Civil Code`    IS TRUE
        `full years of employment with the Policyholder` IS JUST 5

`a person whose premium is unpaid` MEANS
    `The person's particulars` WITH
        `as at`                                          IS YMD 2026 3 1
        `date of birth`                                  IS YMD 1990 5 5
        `recorded in the List of Insured Members`        IS TRUE
        `present in Vietnam`                             IS TRUE
        `holds a valid Enrolment Form`                   IS TRUE
        `premium for this person paid to the Company`    IS FALSE
        `resident in Vietnam`                            IS TRUE
        `of full civil capacity under the Civil Code`    IS TRUE
        `full years of employment with the Policyholder` IS JUST 5

`a person not on the List` MEANS
    `The person's particulars` WITH
        `as at`                                          IS YMD 2026 3 1
        `date of birth`                                  IS YMD 1990 5 5
        `recorded in the List of Insured Members`        IS FALSE
        `present in Vietnam`                             IS TRUE
        `holds a valid Enrolment Form`                   IS TRUE
        `premium for this person paid to the Company`    IS TRUE
        `resident in Vietnam`                            IS TRUE
        `of full civil capacity under the Civil Code`    IS TRUE
        `full years of employment with the Policyholder` IS JUST 5

-- Accounts: the Policyholder's 60,000,000, the Insured Member's 40,000,000, vested at 30%.
`the usual accounts` MEANS
    `The accounts` WITH
        `the Policyholder's account value`   IS 60_000_000
        `the Insured Member's account value` IS 40_000_000
        `the vesting ratio`                  IS 30%

GIVEN `latest reinstatement date` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `state` IS A `A state of the part`
GIVETH AN `An Insured Member's part`
`a Basic Plan part from 15 January 2024, last reinstated` `latest reinstatement date` `, now` `state` MEANS
    `An Insured Member's part` WITH
        `coverage start date`                    IS YMD 2024 1 15
        `maturity date`                          IS YMD 2044 1 15
        `latest reinstatement date`              IS `latest reinstatement date`
        `plan`                                   IS `the Basic Plan`
        `sum insured`                            IS 1_000_000_000
        `sum insured at the coverage start date` IS 1_000_000_000
        `accounts`                               IS `the usual accounts`
        `debt`                                   IS 0
        `state`                                  IS `state`

§§ `Article 1.2`

`an organisation formed to do business` MEANS
    `The Policyholder's particulars` WITH
        `an organisation lawfully established in Vietnam`                                 IS TRUE
        `established for the sole purpose of buying insurance`                            IS FALSE
        `declared and signed the Application`                                             IS TRUE
        `recorded as Policyholder on the Contract Page, a Certificate or an Endorsement`  IS TRUE

`an organisation formed only to buy insurance` MEANS
    `The Policyholder's particulars` WITH
        `an organisation lawfully established in Vietnam`                                 IS TRUE
        `established for the sole purpose of buying insurance`                            IS TRUE
        `declared and signed the Application`                                             IS TRUE
        `recorded as Policyholder on the Contract Page, a Certificate or an Endorsement`  IS TRUE

#ASSERT `1.2 — qualifies as the Policyholder` `an organisation formed to do business`
#ASSERT NOT `1.2 — qualifies as the Policyholder` `an organisation formed only to buy insurance`

§§ `Article 1.8 — the Age`

-- Born 15 June 1980: the day before the 2026 birthday the Age is 45; on it, 46 (fork F1).
#ASSERT `the Age, as at` (YMD 2026 6 14) `, of a person born on` (YMD 1980 6 15) EQUALS 45
#ASSERT `the Age, as at` (YMD 2026 6 15) `, of a person born on` (YMD 1980 6 15) EQUALS 46
#ASSERT `the age in completed months, as at` (YMD 2026 2 28) `, of a person born on` (YMD 2026 1 28) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the age in completed months, as at` (YMD 2026 2 27) `, of a person born on` (YMD 2026 1 28) EQUALS 0

§§ `Article 1.4 — both edges of the age band, and each other condition`

-- 1.4(i): "from 01 month old to 65 years". Request date 1 March 2026.
-- Born 1 February 2026: one month old on 1 March 2026 -> in.  Born 2 February 2026 -> out.
#ASSERT `1.4 — qualifies as an Insured Member` (`a person who meets every other condition of 1.4, as at` (YMD 2026 3 1) `, born on` (YMD 2026 2 1))
#ASSERT NOT `1.4 — qualifies as an Insured Member` (`a person who meets every other condition of 1.4, as at` (YMD 2026 3 1) `, born on` (YMD 2026 2 2))
-- Born 2 March 1960: 65 on 1 March 2026 -> in.  Born 1 March 1960: 66 that day -> out.
#ASSERT `1.4 — qualifies as an Insured Member` (`a person who meets every other condition of 1.4, as at` (YMD 2026 3 1) `, born on` (YMD 1960 3 2))
#ASSERT NOT `1.4 — qualifies as an Insured Member` (`a person who meets every other condition of 1.4, as at` (YMD 2026 3 1) `, born on` (YMD 1960 3 1))
#ASSERT NOT `1.4 — qualifies as an Insured Member` `a person abroad on the request date`
#ASSERT NOT `1.4 — qualifies as an Insured Member` `a person without a valid Enrolment Form`
#ASSERT NOT `1.4 — qualifies as an Insured Member` `a person whose premium is unpaid`
#ASSERT NOT `1.4 — qualifies as an Insured Member` `a person not on the List`

§§ `Article 1.9 — the dates`

-- 1.9.5: a cover starting 31 January: no 28/29/30/31 problem in March; February takes its last day.
#ASSERT `the Monthly Anniversary number` 1 `of` (YMD 2027 1 31) EQUALS YMD 2027 2 28
#ASSERT `the Monthly Anniversary number` 1 `of` (YMD 2028 1 31) EQUALS YMD 2028 2 29
#ASSERT `the Monthly Anniversary number` 2 `of` (YMD 2027 1 31) EQUALS YMD 2027 3 31
#ASSERT `the Monthly Anniversary number` 3 `of` (YMD 2027 1 31) EQUALS YMD 2027 4 30
-- 1.9.6: a cover starting 29 February 2024: "the last day of that month" in 2025; 29 Feb in 2028.
#ASSERT `the Policy Anniversary number` 1 `of` (YMD 2024 2 29) EQUALS YMD 2025 2 28
#ASSERT `the Policy Anniversary number` 4 `of` (YMD 2024 2 29) EQUALS YMD 2028 2 29
-- 1.9.7: start 10 March 2020. Year 1 to 9 March 2021; year 2 from 10 March 2021.
#ASSERT `the insurance year, under a cover starting` (YMD 2020 3 10) `, in which falls` (YMD 2020 3 10) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the insurance year, under a cover starting` (YMD 2020 3 10) `, in which falls` (YMD 2021 3 9) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the insurance year, under a cover starting` (YMD 2020 3 10) `, in which falls` (YMD 2021 3 10) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the insurance year, under a cover starting` (YMD 2020 3 10) `, in which falls` (YMD 2023 3 10) EQUALS 4
#ASSERT REFUSED `the insurance year, under a cover starting` (YMD 2020 3 10) `, in which falls` (YMD 2020 3 9)
#ASSERT `1.9.8 — the insurance year is a Premium Year` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `1.9.8 — the insurance year is a Premium Year` FALSE
#ASSERT `the later of the Coverage Start Date and the latest reinstatement date of` (`a Basic Plan part from 15 January 2024, last reinstated` NOTHING `, now` `in force`) EQUALS YMD 2024 1 15
#ASSERT `the later of the Coverage Start Date and the latest reinstatement date of` (`a Basic Plan part from 15 January 2024, last reinstated` (JUST (YMD 2025 6 1)) `, now` `in force`) EQUALS YMD 2025 6 1

§§ `Articles 1.12 to 1.25 — the arithmetic`

-- 1.12: 8,000,000 basic + 1,000,000 rider = 9,000,000.
#ASSERT `1.12 — the Periodic Premium, of a basic premium` 8_000_000 `and a rider premium` 1_000_000 EQUALS 9_000_000
-- 1.14: (10,000,000 + 2,000,000) less a 50% Initial Charge = 6,000,000.
#ASSERT `1.14 — the Allocated Premium, of` 10_000_000 `basic and` 2_000_000 `top-up at an initial charge rate of` (50%) EQUALS 6_000_000
-- 1.18: 300,000 COI + 47,000 administration = 347,000.
#ASSERT `1.18 — the Monthly Deduction, of` 300_000 `and` 47_000 EQUALS 347_000
-- 1.21: 1,000,000,000 less Debt 3,000,000.
#ASSERT `1.21 — the benefit` 1_000_000_000 `less Debt of` 3_000_000 EQUALS 997_000_000
-- 1.22: 60,000,000 + 40,000,000; and 6,000,000 allocated at a 70% Policyholder share.
#ASSERT `1.22 — the Account Value of` `the usual accounts` EQUALS 100_000_000
#ASSERT (`1.22 — the Allocated Premium` 6_000_000 `split at a Policyholder contribution ratio of` (70%)) EQUALS (`A split between the Policyholder and the Insured Member` WITH `to the Policyholder` IS 4_200_000, `to the Insured Member` IS 1_800_000)
-- 1.23: 100,000,000 less a 5,000,000 Termination Charge; 1.24: less 3,000,000 Debt.
#ASSERT `1.23 — the Surrender Value of` `the usual accounts` `with a termination charge of` 5_000_000 EQUALS 95_000_000
#ASSERT `1.24 — the Net Cash Value of` `the usual accounts` `with a termination charge of` 5_000_000 `and Debt of` 3_000_000 EQUALS 92_000_000
-- 1.25: 30% of 60,000,000 = 18,000,000; the split: 60 - 18 = 42 to the Policyholder, 40 + 18 = 58.
#ASSERT `1.25 — the Vested Account Value of` `the usual accounts` EQUALS 18_000_000
#ASSERT (`the account values, split between the Policyholder and the Insured Member, of` `the usual accounts`) EQUALS (`A split between the Policyholder and the Insured Member` WITH `to the Policyholder` IS 42_000_000, `to the Insured Member` IS 58_000_000)

§§ `Article 2.3`

#ASSERT `2.3 — a change to the Contract or to the Insured Members has effect` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `2.3 — a change to the Contract or to the Insured Members has effect` FALSE

§§ `Article 3 — fixtures`

-- The base case: main product; application stamped 1 March 2026, first premium received
-- 5 March 2026 (so the period begins 5 March); no letter yet; death on 20 March 2026 from an
-- Accident; standard rate; pending Sum Insured 500,000,000; premium 50,000,000; costs 2,000,000.
GIVEN `sum insured` IS A NUMBER
      `premium` IS A NUMBER
      `costs` IS A NUMBER
      `date of death` IS A DATE
      `period ended` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `A death during temporary cover`
`an accidental death under temporary cover, pending sum insured` `sum insured` `, premium` `premium` `, costs` `costs` `, died` `date of death` `, period ended` `period ended` MEANS
    `A death during temporary cover` WITH
        `cover applied for under the main product`                                 IS TRUE
        `date the Company stamped receipt of the complete valid application`      IS YMD 2026 3 1
        `date the Company received the full first premium`                         IS YMD 2026 3 5
        `date the temporary cover period ended`                                    IS `period ended`
        `date of death`                                                            IS `date of death`
        `date of the event that led to death`                                      IS `date of death`
        `an event or continuous chain of events, objective in nature`              IS TRUE
        `caused by a sudden external force or object acting on the body`           IS TRUE
        `the direct and sole cause of death, unrelated to any other cause`         IS TRUE
        `suicide, whether sane or insane`                                          IS FALSE
        `a criminal act of the Insured Member, the Policyholder or a Beneficiary`  IS FALSE
        `would be accepted at the standard rate on the declared information`       IS TRUE
        `total sum insured of the main product on all pending applications for this person` IS `sum insured`
        `total premium paid on all pending applications`                           IS `premium`
        `medical and underwriting costs the Company paid`                          IS `costs`

`the base temporary cover case` MEANS
    `an accidental death under temporary cover, pending sum insured` 500_000_000 `, premium` 50_000_000 `, costs` 2_000_000 `, died` (YMD 2026 3 20) `, period ended` NOTHING

`a suicide under temporary cover` MEANS
    `A death during temporary cover` WITH
        `cover applied for under the main product`                                 IS TRUE
        `date the Company stamped receipt of the complete valid application`      IS YMD 2026 3 1
        `date the Company received the full first premium`                         IS YMD 2026 3 5
        `date the temporary cover period ended`                                    IS NOTHING
        `date of death`                                                            IS YMD 2026 3 20
        `date of the event that led to death`                                      IS YMD 2026 3 20
        `an event or continuous chain of events, objective in nature`              IS TRUE
        `caused by a sudden external force or object acting on the body`           IS TRUE
        `the direct and sole cause of death, unrelated to any other cause`         IS TRUE
        `suicide, whether sane or insane`                                          IS TRUE
        `a criminal act of the Insured Member, the Policyholder or a Beneficiary`  IS FALSE
        `would be accepted at the standard rate on the declared information`       IS TRUE
        `total sum insured of the main product on all pending applications for this person` IS 500_000_000
        `total premium paid on all pending applications`                           IS 50_000_000
        `medical and underwriting costs the Company paid`                          IS 2_000_000

`a death in a crime under temporary cover` MEANS
    `A death during temporary cover` WITH
        `cover applied for under the main product`                                 IS TRUE
        `date the Company stamped receipt of the complete valid application`      IS YMD 2026 3 1
        `date the Company received the full first premium`                         IS YMD 2026 3 5
        `date the temporary cover period ended`                                    IS NOTHING
        `date of death`                                                            IS YMD 2026 3 20
        `date of the event that led to death`                                      IS YMD 2026 3 20
        `an event or continuous chain of events, objective in nature`              IS TRUE
        `caused by a sudden external force or object acting on the body`           IS TRUE
        `the direct and sole cause of death, unrelated to any other cause`         IS TRUE
        `suicide, whether sane or insane`                                          IS FALSE
        `a criminal act of the Insured Member, the Policyholder or a Beneficiary`  IS TRUE
        `would be accepted at the standard rate on the declared information`       IS TRUE
        `total sum insured of the main product on all pending applications for this person` IS 500_000_000
        `total premium paid on all pending applications`                           IS 50_000_000
        `medical and underwriting costs the Company paid`                          IS 2_000_000

-- The accident happened on 2 March, before the period began on 5 March; death on 20 March.
`an accident before the period, death within it` MEANS
    `A death during temporary cover` WITH
        `cover applied for under the main product`                                 IS TRUE
        `date the Company stamped receipt of the complete valid application`      IS YMD 2026 3 1
        `date the Company received the full first premium`                         IS YMD 2026 3 5
        `date the temporary cover period ended`                                    IS NOTHING
        `date of death`                                                            IS YMD 2026 3 20
        `date of the event that led to death`                                      IS YMD 2026 3 2
        `an event or continuous chain of events, objective in nature`              IS TRUE
        `caused by a sudden external force or object acting on the body`           IS TRUE
        `the direct and sole cause of death, unrelated to any other cause`         IS TRUE
        `suicide, whether sane or insane`                                          IS FALSE
        `a criminal act of the Insured Member, the Policyholder or a Beneficiary`  IS FALSE
        `would be accepted at the standard rate on the declared information`       IS TRUE
        `total sum insured of the main product on all pending applications for this person` IS 500_000_000
        `total premium paid on all pending applications`                           IS 50_000_000
        `medical and underwriting costs the Company paid`                          IS 2_000_000

-- A death from illness: the event is not "the direct and sole cause, unrelated to any other".
`a death from illness under temporary cover` MEANS
    `A death during temporary cover` WITH
        `cover applied for under the main product`                                 IS TRUE
        `date the Company stamped receipt of the complete valid application`      IS YMD 2026 3 1
        `date the Company received the full first premium`                         IS YMD 2026 3 5
        `date the temporary cover period ended`                                    IS NOTHING
        `date of death`                                                            IS YMD 2026 3 20
        `date of the event that led to death`                                      IS YMD 2026 3 20
        `an event or continuous chain of events, objective in nature`              IS TRUE
        `caused by a sudden external force or object acting on the body`           IS FALSE
        `the direct and sole cause of death, unrelated to any other cause`         IS FALSE
        `suicide, whether sane or insane`                                          IS FALSE
        `a criminal act of the Insured Member, the Policyholder or a Beneficiary`  IS FALSE
        `would be accepted at the standard rate on the declared information`       IS TRUE
        `total sum insured of the main product on all pending applications for this person` IS 500_000_000
        `total premium paid on all pending applications`                           IS 50_000_000
        `medical and underwriting costs the Company paid`                          IS 2_000_000

`an accidental death of a person who would be rated up` MEANS
    `A death during temporary cover` WITH
        `cover applied for under the main product`                                 IS TRUE
        `date the Company stamped receipt of the complete valid application`      IS YMD 2026 3 1
        `date the Company received the full first premium`                         IS YMD 2026 3 5
        `date the temporary cover period ended`                                    IS NOTHING
        `date of death`                                                            IS YMD 2026 3 20
        `date of the event that led to death`                                      IS YMD 2026 3 20
        `an event or continuous chain of events, objective in nature`              IS TRUE
        `caused by a sudden external force or object acting on the body`           IS TRUE
        `the direct and sole cause of death, unrelated to any other cause`         IS TRUE
        `suicide, whether sane or insane`                                          IS FALSE
        `a criminal act of the Insured Member, the Policyholder or a Beneficiary`  IS FALSE
        `would be accepted at the standard rate on the declared information`       IS FALSE
        `total sum insured of the main product on all pending applications for this person` IS 500_000_000
        `total premium paid on all pending applications`                           IS 50_000_000
        `medical and underwriting costs the Company paid`                          IS 2_000_000

`an accidental death under a rider application` MEANS
    `A death during temporary cover` WITH
        `cover applied for under the main product`                                 IS FALSE
        `date the Company stamped receipt of the complete valid application`      IS YMD 2026 3 1
        `date the Company received the full first premium`                         IS YMD 2026 3 5
        `date the temporary cover period ended`                                    IS NOTHING
        `date of death`                                                            IS YMD 2026 3 20
        `date of the event that led to death`                                      IS YMD 2026 3 20
        `an event or continuous chain of events, objective in nature`              IS TRUE
        `caused by a sudden external force or object acting on the body`           IS TRUE
        `the direct and sole cause of death, unrelated to any other cause`         IS TRUE
        `suicide, whether sane or insane`                                          IS FALSE
        `a criminal act of the Insured Member, the Policyholder or a Beneficiary`  IS FALSE
        `would be accepted at the standard rate on the declared information`       IS TRUE
        `total sum insured of the main product on all pending applications for this person` IS 500_000_000
        `total premium paid on all pending applications`                           IS 50_000_000
        `medical and underwriting costs the Company paid`                          IS 2_000_000

§§ `Article 3 — the period`

-- Stamp 1 March, premium 5 March: the later, 5 March.
#ASSERT `3.1 — the temporary cover period began on` `the base temporary cover case` EQUALS YMD 2026 3 5
#ASSERT NOT `3.1 — under` `the base temporary cover case` `, the temporary cover period includes` (YMD 2026 3 4)
#ASSERT `3.1 — under` `the base temporary cover case` `, the temporary cover period includes` (YMD 2026 3 5)
-- Contract issued 15 March: a death that day is inside (fork F5), the next day outside.
#ASSERT `Article 3 — the outcome of a death during temporary cover` (`an accidental death under temporary cover, pending sum insured` 500_000_000 `, premium` 50_000_000 `, costs` 0 `, died` (YMD 2026 3 15) `, period ended` (JUST (YMD 2026 3 15))) EQUALS `the temporary benefit, with no refund of premium, of` 200_000_000
#ASSERT `Article 3 — the outcome of a death during temporary cover` (`an accidental death under temporary cover, pending sum insured` 500_000_000 `, premium` 50_000_000 `, costs` 0 `, died` (YMD 2026 3 16) `, period ended` (JUST (YMD 2026 3 15))) EQUALS `no temporary benefit is payable`
#ASSERT `Article 3 — the outcome of a death during temporary cover` (`an accidental death under temporary cover, pending sum insured` 500_000_000 `, premium` 50_000_000 `, costs` 0 `, died` (YMD 2026 3 4) `, period ended` NOTHING) EQUALS `no temporary benefit is payable`

§§ `Article 3 — the amount, both sides of 200,000,000`

-- Pending Sum Insured 500,000,000 -> the lesser, 200,000,000; 150,000,000 -> 150,000,000.
#ASSERT `Article 3 — the outcome of a death during temporary cover` `the base temporary cover case` EQUALS `the temporary benefit, with no refund of premium, of` 200_000_000
#ASSERT `Article 3 — the outcome of a death during temporary cover` (`an accidental death under temporary cover, pending sum insured` 150_000_000 `, premium` 50_000_000 `, costs` 0 `, died` (YMD 2026 3 20) `, period ended` NOTHING) EQUALS `the temporary benefit, with no refund of premium, of` 150_000_000
-- Premium exactly 200,000,000 is not "greater than": the benefit. 200,000,001: the premium back.
#ASSERT `Article 3 — the outcome of a death during temporary cover` (`an accidental death under temporary cover, pending sum insured` 500_000_000 `, premium` 200_000_000 `, costs` 0 `, died` (YMD 2026 3 20) `, period ended` NOTHING) EQUALS `the temporary benefit, with no refund of premium, of` 200_000_000
#ASSERT `Article 3 — the outcome of a death during temporary cover` (`an accidental death under temporary cover, pending sum insured` 500_000_000 `, premium` 200_000_001 `, costs` 0 `, died` (YMD 2026 3 20) `, period ended` NOTHING) EQUALS `a refund of the premium paid, without interest, of` 200_000_001
#ASSERT `Article 3 — the premium refunded` `the base temporary cover case` EQUALS 0

§§ `Article 3 — each 3.3 cause, with its near miss`

-- Suicide: 50,000,000 - 2,000,000 = 48,000,000. Its near miss (no suicide) is the base case.
#ASSERT `Article 3 — the outcome of a death during temporary cover` `a suicide under temporary cover` EQUALS `a refund of the premium paid, without interest, of` 48_000_000
#ASSERT `Article 3 — the outcome of a death during temporary cover` `a death in a crime under temporary cover` EQUALS `a refund of the premium paid, without interest, of` 48_000_000
#ASSERT `Article 3 — the outcome of a death during temporary cover` `an accident before the period, death within it` EQUALS `a refund of the premium paid, without interest, of` 48_000_000
#ASSERT NOT `3.3 — the death has a cause listed in 3.3` `the base temporary cover case`

§§ `Article 3 — what is not covered`

#ASSERT NOT `3.1 — the death was caused by an Accident` `a death from illness under temporary cover`
#ASSERT `Article 3 — the outcome of a death during temporary cover` `a death from illness under temporary cover` EQUALS `no temporary benefit is payable`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 3 — the premium refunded` `a death from illness under temporary cover`
#ASSERT `Article 3 — the outcome of a death during temporary cover` `an accidental death of a person who would be rated up` EQUALS `no temporary benefit is payable`
#ASSERT `Article 3 — the outcome of a death during temporary cover` `an accidental death under a rider application` EQUALS `no temporary benefit is payable`

§§ `Article 4`

-- 4.1: 100,000,000 premium - 10,000,000 withdrawn - 5,000,000 Debt = 85,000,000.
#ASSERT `4.1 — the Policyholder may terminate the Contract unilaterally` TRUE
#ASSERT `4.1 — the refund` (`A refund under Article 4.1` WITH `total premium paid` IS 100_000_000, `account value withdrawals` IS 10_000_000, `debt` IS 5_000_000) EQUALS 85_000_000

GIVEN `state authority` IS A BOOLEAN
      `listed purpose` IS A BOOLEAN
      `written consent` IS A BOOLEAN
      `informed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A transfer of personal information`
`a transfer:` `state authority` `,` `listed purpose` `,` `written consent` `,` `informed` MEANS
    `A transfer of personal information` WITH
        `at the request of a competent state authority`                          IS `state authority`
        `for a purpose listed in 4.2(a)`                                         IS `listed purpose`
        `consented to in writing by the Policyholder or the Insured Member`      IS `written consent`
        `the person was told the purpose and given the choice to consent or not` IS `informed`

#ASSERT `4.2 — the Company may transfer the information to a third party` (`a transfer:` TRUE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE)
#ASSERT `4.2 — the Company may transfer the information to a third party` (`a transfer:` FALSE `,` TRUE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE)
#ASSERT `4.2 — the Company may transfer the information to a third party` (`a transfer:` FALSE `,` FALSE `,` TRUE `,` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `4.2 — the Company may transfer the information to a third party` (`a transfer:` FALSE `,` FALSE `,` TRUE `,` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `4.2 — the Company may transfer the information to a third party` (`a transfer:` FALSE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE)

§§ `Article 5`

GIVEN `deliberate` IS A BOOLEAN
      `would have declined` IS A BOOLEAN
      `would have charged more` IS A BOOLEAN
      `affected the decision` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A breach of the duty to declare`
`a breach:` `deliberate` `,` `would have declined` `,` `would have charged more` `,` `affected the decision` MEANS
    `A breach of the duty to declare` WITH
        `deliberate`                                                            IS `deliberate`
        `the Company would not have accepted the risk had it known`             IS `would have declined`
        `the Company would have accepted only at a higher premium had it known` IS `would have charged more`
        `it affected the decision to accept or to reinstate`                    IS `affected the decision`
        `an inaccurate or omitted declaration of age or gender only`            IS FALSE

GIVEN `benefits paid` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A refund under Article 5.2`
`a 5.2 refund after benefits of` `benefits paid` MEANS
    `A refund under Article 5.2` WITH
        `accounts`              IS `the usual accounts`
        `termination charge`    IS 5_000_000
        `debt`                  IS 3_000_000
        `benefits already paid` IS `benefits paid`

-- 5.2: Net Cash Value 100 - 5 - 3 = 92,000,000 less benefits 0; less benefits 120,000,000
-- gives nothing, and nothing is clawed back.
#ASSERT `Article 5 — the consequence of` (`a breach:` TRUE `,` TRUE `,` FALSE `,` TRUE) `, with a refund computed from` (`a 5.2 refund after benefits of` 0) EQUALS `the part is terminated, and the Net Cash Value less benefits paid is refunded:` 92_000_000
#ASSERT `Article 5 — the consequence of` (`a breach:` TRUE `,` TRUE `,` FALSE `,` TRUE) `, with a refund computed from` (`a 5.2 refund after benefits of` 120_000_000) EQUALS `the part is terminated, and the Net Cash Value less benefits paid is refunded:` 0
-- 5.3: a breach that did not affect the decision.
#ASSERT `Article 5 — the consequence of` (`a breach:` FALSE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE) `, with a refund computed from` (`a 5.2 refund after benefits of` 0) EQUALS `benefits remain payable; the Company may charge more premium or reduce the Sum Insured`
#ASSERT `Article 5 — the consequence of` (`a breach:` TRUE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE) `, with a refund computed from` (`a 5.2 refund after benefits of` 0) EQUALS `benefits remain payable; the Company may charge more premium or reduce the Sum Insured`
-- The gaps (finding X5): an innocent breach that would have changed the decision; a deliberate
-- one that would only have raised the premium.
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 5 — the consequence of` (`a breach:` FALSE `,` TRUE `,` FALSE `,` TRUE) `, with a refund computed from` (`a 5.2 refund after benefits of` 0)
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 5 — the consequence of` (`a breach:` TRUE `,` FALSE `,` TRUE `,` TRUE) `, with a refund computed from` (`a 5.2 refund after benefits of` 0)

§§ `Article 6`

GIVEN `true date of birth` IS A DATE
      `account value` IS A NUMBER
      `premium` IS A NUMBER
      `withdrawals` IS A NUMBER
      `costs` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The money in a part at the Company's notice`
`a part found misstated, true birth` `true date of birth` `, account value` `account value` `, premium` `premium` `, withdrawals` `withdrawals` `, costs` `costs` MEANS
    `The money in a part at the Company's notice` WITH
        `date of birth as declared`                           IS YMD 1970 1 1
        `true date of birth`                                  IS `true date of birth`
        `coverage start date`                                 IS YMD 2024 1 15
        `account value at the Company's notice`               IS `account value`
        `premium paid for the part`                           IS `premium`
        `premium paid by the Insured Member`                  IS `premium` TIMES 25%
        `premium paid by the Policyholder`                    IS `premium` TIMES 75%
        `benefits paid`                                       IS 0
        `withdrawals from the Insured Member's account value` IS `withdrawals`
        `debt`                                                IS 0
        `reasonable underwriting costs`                       IS `costs`
        `accounts`                                            IS `the usual accounts`

-- 6.1: true birth 1 January 1970 -> 54 at the 2024 start: within. True birth 1 January 1958
-- -> 66: outside, so 6.2.
#ASSERT `6.1 — the true Age is within the insurable ages` (`a part found misstated, true birth` (YMD 1970 1 1) `, account value` 100_000_000 `, premium` 80_000_000 `, withdrawals` 10_000_000 `, costs` 1_000_000)
#ASSERT NOT `6.1 — the true Age is within the insurable ages` (`a part found misstated, true birth` (YMD 1958 1 1) `, account value` 100_000_000 `, premium` 80_000_000 `, withdrawals` 10_000_000 `, costs` 1_000_000)
-- 6.2: greater of 100,000,000 and 80,000,000 = 100,000,000; less withdrawals 10,000,000 and
-- costs 1,000,000 = 89,000,000.
#ASSERT `6.2 — the refund` (`a part found misstated, true birth` (YMD 1958 1 1) `, account value` 100_000_000 `, premium` 80_000_000 `, withdrawals` 10_000_000 `, costs` 1_000_000) EQUALS 89_000_000
-- Premium the greater: 80,000,000 - 10,000,000 - 1,000,000 = 69,000,000.
#ASSERT `6.2 — the refund` (`a part found misstated, true birth` (YMD 1958 1 1) `, account value` 50_000_000 `, premium` 80_000_000 `, withdrawals` 10_000_000 `, costs` 1_000_000) EQUALS 69_000_000
#ASSERT REFUSED `6.2 — the refund` (`a part found misstated, true birth` (YMD 1958 1 1) `, account value` 5_000_000 `, premium` 8_000_000 `, withdrawals` 10_000_000 `, costs` 1_000_000)
-- 6.2(a), Account Value refunded: the account split 42,000,000 / 58,000,000.
#ASSERT (`6.2 — the refund split, before deductions` (`a part found misstated, true birth` (YMD 1958 1 1) `, account value` 100_000_000 `, premium` 80_000_000 `, withdrawals` 10_000_000 `, costs` 1_000_000)) EQUALS (`A split between the Policyholder and the Insured Member` WITH `to the Policyholder` IS 42_000_000, `to the Insured Member` IS 58_000_000)
-- 6.2(b), premium refunded: the Insured Member paid 25% (20,000,000) and the Policyholder 75%
-- (60,000,000), vested at 30%: Policyholder 70% x 60 = 42,000,000; Insured Member 20 + 18 = 38,000,000.
#ASSERT (`6.2 — the refund split, before deductions` (`a part found misstated, true birth` (YMD 1958 1 1) `, account value` 50_000_000 `, premium` 80_000_000 `, withdrawals` 10_000_000 `, costs` 1_000_000)) EQUALS (`A split between the Policyholder and the Insured Member` WITH `to the Policyholder` IS 42_000_000, `to the Insured Member` IS 38_000_000)
#ASSERT REFUSED `6.2 — the refund split, after deductions` (`a part found misstated, true birth` (YMD 1958 1 1) `, account value` 50_000_000 `, premium` 80_000_000 `, withdrawals` 10_000_000 `, costs` 1_000_000)

§§ `Article 7`

GIVEN `deliberate` IS A BOOLEAN
      `age or gender` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A breach of the duty to declare`
`a misdeclaration:` `deliberate` `,` `age or gender` MEANS
    `A breach of the duty to declare` WITH
        `deliberate`                                                            IS `deliberate`
        `the Company would not have accepted the risk had it known`             IS TRUE
        `the Company would have accepted only at a higher premium had it known` IS FALSE
        `it affected the decision to accept or to reinstate`                    IS TRUE
        `an inaccurate or omitted declaration of age or gender only`            IS `age or gender`

-- Start 15 January 2024: 24 months on 15 January 2026 ("at least 24 months": barred that day).
#ASSERT `7.1 — the Company may not cancel` (`a Basic Plan part from 15 January 2024, last reinstated` NOTHING `, now` `in force`) `for` (`a misdeclaration:` FALSE `,` FALSE) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
#ASSERT NOT `7.1 — the Company may not cancel` (`a Basic Plan part from 15 January 2024, last reinstated` NOTHING `, now` `in force`) `for` (`a misdeclaration:` FALSE `,` FALSE) `on` (YMD 2026 1 14)
#ASSERT NOT `7.1 — the Company may not cancel` (`a Basic Plan part from 15 January 2024, last reinstated` NOTHING `, now` `in force`) `for` (`a misdeclaration:` TRUE `,` FALSE) `on` (YMD 2030 1 15)
#ASSERT NOT `7.1 — the Company may not cancel` (`a Basic Plan part from 15 January 2024, last reinstated` NOTHING `, now` `in force`) `for` (`a misdeclaration:` FALSE `,` TRUE) `on` (YMD 2030 1 15)
-- Reinstated 1 June 2025: the 24 months restart and run to 1 June 2027.
#ASSERT NOT `7.1 — the Company may not cancel` (`a Basic Plan part from 15 January 2024, last reinstated` (JUST (YMD 2025 6 1)) `, now` `in force`) `for` (`a misdeclaration:` FALSE `,` FALSE) `on` (YMD 2026 1 15)
#ASSERT `7.1 — the Company may not cancel` (`a Basic Plan part from 15 January 2024, last reinstated` (JUST (YMD 2025 6 1)) `, now` `in force`) `for` (`a misdeclaration:` FALSE `,` FALSE) `on` (YMD 2027 6 1)

