#ASSERT NOT `8 — a payment by the Company conforms` TRUE `and` FALSE

§§ `Article 9`

#ASSERT `9.1 — the payee of` `the death benefit` EQUALS LIST `the Beneficiary`
#ASSERT `9.1 — the payee of` `the funeral benefit` EQUALS LIST `the Beneficiary`
#ASSERT `9.1 — the payee of` `a withdrawal` EQUALS LIST `the Insured Member`
#ASSERT `9.1 — the payee of` `the maturity benefit` EQUALS LIST `the Policyholder`, `the Insured Member`
#ASSERT REFUSED `9.1 — the payee of` `the account value under Article 15`

#ASSERT `9.2 — the change of Beneficiary has effect` (`A change of Beneficiary` WITH `made in writing by the Insured Member personally` IS TRUE, `approved by the Company by Endorsement` IS TRUE, `consented to by the existing Beneficiaries` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `9.2 — the change of Beneficiary has effect` (`A change of Beneficiary` WITH `made in writing by the Insured Member personally` IS TRUE, `approved by the Company by Endorsement` IS FALSE, `consented to by the existing Beneficiaries` IS TRUE)

GIVEN `name` IS A STRING
      `specified share` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `alive` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A Beneficiary designation`
`Beneficiary` `name` `share` `specified share` `survived` `alive` MEANS
    `A Beneficiary designation` WITH
        `name`                                          IS `name`
        `specified share`                               IS `specified share`
        `survived the Insured Member`                   IS `alive`
        `died at the same moment as the Insured Member` IS FALSE

GIVEN `payee` IS A STRING
      `share` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A share of the death proceeds`
`the share to` `payee` `of` `share` MEANS
    `A share of the death proceeds` WITH
        `payee` IS `payee`
        `share` IS `share`

-- No Beneficiary, or every one predeceased: the legal heirs.
#ASSERT `9.3 — who receives the death proceeds, under the designations` EMPTY EQUALS `the legal heirs of the Insured Member, in full`
#ASSERT `9.3 — who receives the death proceeds, under the designations` (LIST `Beneficiary` "An" `share` NOTHING `survived` FALSE) EQUALS `the legal heirs of the Insured Member, in full`
-- Two, no shares fixed: half each.
#ASSERT `9.3 — who receives the death proceeds, under the designations` (LIST `Beneficiary` "An" `share` NOTHING `survived` TRUE, `Beneficiary` "Binh" `share` NOTHING `survived` TRUE) EQUALS `the Beneficiaries, in these shares` (LIST (`the share to` "An" `of` (1 DIVIDED BY 2)), (`the share to` "Binh" `of` (1 DIVIDED BY 2)))
-- Three, no shares, one predeceased: the two others half each.
#ASSERT `9.3 — who receives the death proceeds, under the designations` (LIST `Beneficiary` "An" `share` NOTHING `survived` TRUE, `Beneficiary` "Binh" `share` NOTHING `survived` FALSE, `Beneficiary` "Chi" `share` NOTHING `survived` TRUE) EQUALS `the Beneficiaries, in these shares` (LIST (`the share to` "An" `of` (1 DIVIDED BY 2)), (`the share to` "Chi" `of` (1 DIVIDED BY 2)))
-- Shares 50/30/20, the 20% Beneficiary predeceased: 10% more to each survivor -> 60/40.
#ASSERT `9.3 — who receives the death proceeds, under the designations` (LIST `Beneficiary` "An" `share` (JUST 0.5) `survived` TRUE, `Beneficiary` "Binh" `share` (JUST 0.3) `survived` TRUE, `Beneficiary` "Chi" `share` (JUST 0.2) `survived` FALSE) EQUALS `the Beneficiaries, in these shares` (LIST (`the share to` "An" `of` (0.6)), (`the share to` "Binh" `of` (0.4)))
#ASSERT REFUSED `9.3 — who receives the death proceeds, under the designations` (LIST `Beneficiary` "An" `share` (JUST 0.5) `survived` TRUE, `Beneficiary` "Binh" `share` NOTHING `survived` TRUE)

