#ASSERT (`10.2 — the payment split, before deductions` (`a part found misstated, true birth` (YMD 1970 1 1) `, account value` 100_000_000 `, premium` 80_000_000 `, withdrawals` 10_000_000 `, costs` 1_000_000)) EQUALS (`A split between the Policyholder and the Insured Member` WITH `to the Policyholder` IS 42_000_000, `to the Insured Member` IS 58_000_000)

